# A Clan's Reputation (Q508), refused at the turn-in (#5167): the quest owner left the clan
# holding the Themis scale for raid 1. Sir Eric Rodemai answers the not-a-leader page before
# anything is taken: the scale stays, no reputation is paid and the quest keeps its raid.
# Hand-written from the quest script (no reference trace): the reference takes the scale,
# then fails on the missing clan and answers nothing.
character Leader 40
quest Q508_AClansReputation <state>=STARTED <cond>=1 raid=1
hold 8277 1
script quest.Q508_AClansReputation
item 8277
page default/30868.htm
page script/quest/Q508_AClansReputation/
npc eric 30868 Folk 10 0 0

action eric
action eric
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=eric item=0 page=default/30868.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{eric}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=eric item=0 page=script/quest/Q508_AClansReputation/30868-0a.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  items 8277=1
  state Q508_AClansReputation STARTED
  rows Q508_AClansReputation <cond>=1 <state>=STARTED raid=1
